d it to outline to be a bit more accurate.\r\nThe functionality should be pretty much the same.\r\n\r\nUnified the members overview and help overview ItemLists and methods.\r\nThere does not need to be separate ItemLists, only one is shown at a time and it doesn't store state.\r\nThere does not need to be multiple visibility methods, they were always called right after another and the logic is much simpler this way.\r\n\r\nThe visibility updating does not need to touch the filter and sort button individually, they are both in an HBoxContainer that can be used instead.\r\nThe current tab range check in `_update_help_overview_visibility` only caught cases where no editor is open, but the next nullptr check would catch that anyway.\r\n\r\nThe only information needed from the ScriptEditor is the current active editor (ScriptEditorBase or EditorHelp), I made a method for it.\r\n\r\nAlso changed the filter to be a FilterLineEdit, so up and down can be used to change selected item while focused in the filter.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo